      "note": "Derived from two Nutritional Info panels whose component lists are identical apart from Bacon: Chicken & Egg Deluxe (PLU 212006001-1: 262 g, 2620 kJ, P 35.9, F 31.1, sat 6.9, C 57.7, sugars 14.9, Na 1345) minus Chicken & Egg Burger (PLU 212006004-1: 245 g, 2470 kJ, P 31.1, F 29.3, sat 6.3, C 57.4, sugars 14.6, Na 1045). Check: 17x4.8+37x1.8+17x0.3 = 153 kJ. Corroborated by the 'Add Bacon (1 piece)' modifier (PLU 212999205, 160 kJ / 38 Cal) offered in the Customise list of every item it is used for. Oporto doesn't say how many pieces each item has. The ordering feed's own item kJ for the same pair (2870 vs 2620) would give 250 kJ, but the Nutritional Info panels are the menu file's source."
    },
